@apiUrl = https://fw-teaching.fi/demo/wdbocms/api/v1/products/
### get all products
GET {{apiUrl}}
### get one product
GET {{apiUrl}}/1002

### create a new product
POST {{apiUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

 {
      "name": "Jeans",
      "price": 49
    }


### Update product info
PATCH {{apiUrl}}/1001

Content-Type: application/json
{
      "price": 29
    }

### Delete product

DELETE {{apiUrl}}/1004